# The local bind-mount default. Never bake content into the image.
.local-content
private/*
# Go build output — the image builds its own from source in tools/.
#
# `tools/*/<name>`, NOT `tools/**/<name>`: Docker's `**` matches zero segments
# too, so the double-star form also matched the MODULE DIRECTORY
# `tools/drupalcon-sync` and kept the whole tool out of the build context. The
# image built without it, the cronjob calling it failed with "not found", and
# nothing about the build said so.
tools/*/drupalcon-sync
tools/*/server
